        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/eada6e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-12-15T21:46:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Time to necro a thread!</p><p>Since I'm new to the game, I had a couple questions about these.&nbsp; I understand the system is pretty DIY, but I wondered about the intention of one&nbsp;of them:</p><p>1) For \"Heroic Dedication,\" is it just to play a game with that hero and win? Thus, if I played a game with Haka, Ra, and Legacy, and we won, we'd get all three of those awards?</p><p>2) So it's been some time: should we still wait for new challenges for the expansions?</p>",
