        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/f08c70/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-24T00:31:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm currently drafting some Unofficial Story Challenges for the Expansions and Promo Cards.&nbsp; You can view my work in progress (version 0.01) here:</p><p>https://docs.google.com/file/d/0BypJSleG9RhhOTJyUmRLdjdkb00/edit?usp=sharing</p><p>Suggestions and comments are welcome.&nbsp; I try to match the format of the original document as much as possible, while keeping it entirely separate from the official Story Challenges.&nbsp; Also, the last couple of pages are design notes, so you can see what stupid thing I was thinking at the time.</p>",
